</div>
</section></div><figcaption>paused=false</figcaption></figure>
</div></section>
<section><h3>done (con y sin)</h3><div class="ds-gallery__row">
<figure><div class="ds-gallery__stage"><section data-ds="timer" class="timer" data-state="done" aria-labelledby="timer-title-v4">
